{"id": "017d5faf-aaef-4c52-be3a-2c0261ed8312", "role": "assistant", "block_type": "thinking", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The relevant skill for Bedrock spend explicitly points elsewhere to a cost skill that isn't installed, so I'll need to pull this from Cost Explorer directly—querying cost and usage grouped by usage type should be a lightweight, bounded lookup rather than something expensive, even though explaining the doubling touches on root-cause territory.

